#: ../../tips_and_tricks/useful_info/insert_overwrite_advanced_timeline_editing.rst:16
msgid "Insert and Overwrite: Advanced Timeline Editing"
msgstr "Vkladanie a prepísanie: Pokročilá úprava časovej osi"

#: ../../tips_and_tricks/useful_info/insert_overwrite_advanced_timeline_editing.rst:20
msgid ""
"Kdenlive offers advanced timeline editing functions. In this chapter we are "
"looking at the **Insert** |timeline-insert| and **Overwrite** |timeline-"
"overwrite| advanced editing functions."
msgstr ""
"Kdenlive ponúka pokročilé funkcie úpravy časovej osi. V tejto kapitole sa "
"pozrieme na pokročilé funkcie úpravy **Vložiť** |timeline-insert| a "
"**Prepísať** |timeline-overwrite|."

#: ../../tips_and_tricks/useful_info/insert_overwrite_advanced_timeline_editing.rst:22
msgid ""
"When inserting or overwriting some part in the timeline with some part from "
"a clip, we now face two zones, so how does this work out at all? We only "
"want to deal with three points, that is, with one zone and a point (for that "
"reason this is also sometimes called **3-Point Editing**). In consequence, "
"there are two different insert/overwrite operations:"
msgstr ""
"Pri vkladaní alebo prepisovaní nejakej časti v časovej osi nejakou časťou "
"klipu čelíme dvom zónam, takže ako to vôbec funguje? Chceme pracovať iba s "
"tromi bodmi, teda s jednou zónou a jedným bodom (preto sa to niekedy nazýva "
"aj **Editovanie 3 bodmi**). V dôsledku toho existujú dve rôzne operácie "
"vloženia/prepísania:"

#: ../../tips_and_tricks/useful_info/insert_overwrite_advanced_timeline_editing.rst:24
msgid ""
"Insert/overwrite a clip zone into the timeline at some point (cursor/"
"playhead), or"
msgstr ""
"Vložiť/prepísať zónu klipu do časovej osi v nejakom bode (kurzor/prehrávač), "
"alebo"

#: ../../tips_and_tricks/useful_info/insert_overwrite_advanced_timeline_editing.rst:25
msgid "Insert/overwrite a clip starting at some point into a timeline zone"
msgstr "Vložiť/prepísať klip začínajúci v nejakom bode do zóny časovej osi"

#: ../../tips_and_tricks/useful_info/insert_overwrite_advanced_timeline_editing.rst:27
msgid ""
"Kdenlive’s timeline IN/OUT system has one basic difference to other video "
"editors: **Kdenlive doesn't have**:"
msgstr ""
"Systém IN/OUT časovej osi Kdenlive má jeden základný rozdiel oproti iným "
"video editorom: **Kdenlive nemá**:"

#: ../../tips_and_tricks/useful_info/insert_overwrite_advanced_timeline_editing.rst:29
msgid "IN/OUT points for 3-point editing and"
msgstr "Body IN/OUT pre editovanie 3 bodmi a"

#: ../../tips_and_tricks/useful_info/insert_overwrite_advanced_timeline_editing.rst:30
msgid "IN/OUT points to set the rendering area."
msgstr "Body IN/OUT na nastavenie oblasti renderovania."

#: ../../tips_and_tricks/useful_info/insert_overwrite_advanced_timeline_editing.rst:32
msgid ""
"In Kdenlive we use the same timeline IN/OUT points for both functions. For "
"this reason, we have a button to enable |timeline-use-zone-on| / disable |"
"timeline-use-zone-off| the timeline zone for the task. Instead of removing "
"the reference points you just disable |timeline-use-zone-on| the timeline "
"zone. This has the advantage to preserve a set area (IN/OUT zone) and be "
"able to work on the playhead/cursor reference only, without having to cancel "
"the zone."
msgstr ""
"V Kdenlive používame rovnaké body IN/OUT časovej osi pre obe funkcie. Z "
"tohto dôvodu máme tlačidlo na povolenie |timeline-use-zone-on| / zakázanie |"
"timeline-use-zone-off| zóny časovej osi pre danú úlohu. Namiesto "
"odstraňovania referenčných bodov jednoducho zakážete |timeline-use-zone-on| "
"zónu časovej osi. Toto má výhodu zachovania nastavenej oblasti (zóna IN/OUT) "
"a možnosť pracovať iba s referenciou prehrávača/kurzora bez nutnosti zrušiť "
"zónu."

#: ../../tips_and_tricks/useful_info/insert_overwrite_advanced_timeline_editing.rst:38
msgid "Insert Clip Zone into Timeline at Timeline Cursor"
msgstr "Vložiť zónu klipu do časovej osi na pozíciu kurzora časovej osi"

#: ../../tips_and_tricks/useful_info/insert_overwrite_advanced_timeline_editing.rst:48
#: ../../tips_and_tricks/useful_info/insert_overwrite_advanced_timeline_editing.rst:184
#: ../../tips_and_tricks/useful_info/insert_overwrite_advanced_timeline_editing.rst:242
msgid "Toggle the use of the timeline zone"
msgstr "Prepínač použitia zóny časovej osi"

#: ../../tips_and_tricks/useful_info/insert_overwrite_advanced_timeline_editing.rst:50
msgid ""
"As we are going to insert a clip zone into the timeline, first make sure "
"that the switch for Using Timeline Zone |timeline-use-zone-off| is crossed "
"out (it is *off*)."
msgstr ""
"Keďže budeme vkladať zónu klipu do časovej osi, najprv sa uistite, že "
"prepínač Použiť zónu časovej osi |timeline-use-zone-off| je prečiarknutý (je "
"*vypnutý*)."

#: ../../tips_and_tricks/useful_info/insert_overwrite_advanced_timeline_editing.rst:52
#: ../../tips_and_tricks/useful_info/insert_overwrite_advanced_timeline_editing.rst:188
msgid ""
"The **timeline zone bar** is now *dimmed* and does not show the zone "
"duration."
msgstr ""
"Panel **zóny časovej osi** je teraz *stlmený* a nezobrazuje trvanie zóny."

#: ../../tips_and_tricks/useful_info/insert_overwrite_advanced_timeline_editing.rst:62
msgid "Setting the clip region for insertion"
msgstr "Nastavenie oblasti klipu na vloženie"

#: ../../tips_and_tricks/useful_info/insert_overwrite_advanced_timeline_editing.rst:64
msgid ""
"Next, mark the **clip region** of the source clip you want to insert into "
"the timeline. You do this as usual, using either the :kbd:`I` and :kbd:`O` "
"shortcuts, or the set Zone In |zone-in| / Zone Out |zone-out| buttons of the "
"clip monitor."
msgstr ""
"Ďalej označte **oblasť klipu** zdrojového klipu, ktorý chcete vložiť do "
"časovej osi. Urobíte to ako zvyčajne, pomocou skratiek :kbd:`I` a :kbd:`O`, "
"alebo tlačidiel nastavenia vstupnej zóny |zone-in| / výstupnej zóny |zone-"
"out| monitora klipu."

#: ../../tips_and_tricks/useful_info/insert_overwrite_advanced_timeline_editing.rst:74
msgid "Setting the insertion point in the timeline"
msgstr "Nastavenie bodu vloženia v časovej osi"

#: ../../tips_and_tricks/useful_info/insert_overwrite_advanced_timeline_editing.rst:76
msgid ""
"Now **place the timeline cursor** to where you want to start with the insert."
msgstr ""
"Teraz **umiestnite kurzor časovej osi** na miesto, kde chcete začať "
"vkladanie."

#: ../../tips_and_tricks/useful_info/insert_overwrite_advanced_timeline_editing.rst:78
msgid ""
"Also make sure to select the **correct track** using the :kbd:`Up` and :kbd:"
"`Down` keys to navigate up and down the track list and then :kbd:`Shift+T` "
"to mark the track as the target for the operation. The currently selected "
"track is marked with a semi-transparent selection color (depending on your "
"particular color theme); the **active** track is marked with a green box "
"(see **(1)** in the screenshot)"
msgstr ""
"Taktiež sa uistite, že ste vybrali **správnu stopu** pomocou kláves :kbd:"
"`Hore` a :kbd:`Dole` na navigáciu v zozname stôp a potom :kbd:`Shift+T` na "
"označenie stopy ako cieľa operácie. Aktuálne vybraná stopa je označená "
"polopriesvitnou farbou výberu (v závislosti od vášho farebného motívu); "
"**aktívna** stopa je označená zeleným rámčekom (pozri **(1)** na snímke "
"obrazovky)"

#: ../../tips_and_tricks/useful_info/insert_overwrite_advanced_timeline_editing.rst:88
#: ../../tips_and_tricks/useful_info/insert_overwrite_advanced_timeline_editing.rst:98
msgid "Clip region inserted in the timeline"
msgstr "Oblasť klipu vložená do časovej osi"

#: ../../tips_and_tricks/useful_info/insert_overwrite_advanced_timeline_editing.rst:90
#: ../../tips_and_tricks/useful_info/insert_overwrite_advanced_timeline_editing.rst:162
msgid ""
"Finally press the :kbd:`V` shortcut, or click the Insert Clip Zone toolbar "
"button |timeline-insert|, or use :menuselection:`Menu --> Sequence --> "
"Insertion --> Insert Clip Zone in Timeline`."
msgstr ""
"Nakoniec stlačte skratku :kbd:`V`, alebo kliknite na tlačidlo panela "
"nástrojov Vložiť zónu klipu |timeline-insert|, alebo použite :menuselection:"
"`Ponuka --> Sekvencia --> Vloženie --> Vložiť zónu klipu do časovej osi`."

#: ../../tips_and_tricks/useful_info/insert_overwrite_advanced_timeline_editing.rst:100
msgid ""
"Note that the insert shifted also not-active tracks to make room for the "
"inserted clip. In order to avoid that, lock the other tracks by clicking on "
"the |track-unlocked| icon in the track header (see **(2)** in the "
"screenshots)."
msgstr ""
"Upozorňujeme, že vloženie posunulo aj neaktívne stopy, aby uvoľnilo miesto "
"pre vložený klip. Aby ste tomu zabránili, zamknite ostatné stopy kliknutím "
"na ikonu |track-unlocked| v záhlaví stopy (pozri **(2)** na snímkach "
"obrazovky)."

#: ../../tips_and_tricks/useful_info/insert_overwrite_advanced_timeline_editing.rst:106
msgid ""
"Insertion starts at the timeline cursor, and not at the timeline zone start "
"(because we chose to ignore it in our very first step)."
msgstr ""
"Vkladanie začína na kurzore časovej osi, a nie na začiatku zóny časovej osi "
"(pretože sme sa rozhodli ignorovať ju v prvom kroku)."

#: ../../tips_and_tricks/useful_info/insert_overwrite_advanced_timeline_editing.rst:107
#: ../../tips_and_tricks/useful_info/insert_overwrite_advanced_timeline_editing.rst:229
msgid "Locked tracks are unaffected, such as the topmost track in our example."
msgstr ""
"Zamknuté stopy nie sú ovplyvnené, napríklad najhornajšia stopa v našom "
"príklade."

#: ../../tips_and_tricks/useful_info/insert_overwrite_advanced_timeline_editing.rst:108
msgid ""
"Unlocked tracks get affected in that whatever is at the insertion point and "
"later in the timeline gets shifted away to make room for the insertion."
msgstr ""
"Nezamknuté stopy sú ovplyvnené v tom zmysle, že všetko na bode vloženia a "
"neskôr v časovej osi sa posunie, aby sa uvoľnilo miesto pre vloženie."

#: ../../tips_and_tricks/useful_info/insert_overwrite_advanced_timeline_editing.rst:111
msgid "Insert Clip (from In Point) into Timeline Zone"
msgstr "Vložiť klip (od vstupného bodu) do zóny časovej osi"

#: ../../tips_and_tricks/useful_info/insert_overwrite_advanced_timeline_editing.rst:121
msgid ""
"This time, we are going to insert some part of a clip to *exactly fit* into "
"the timeline zone. So we now need to switch on Using the Timeline Zone |"
"timeline-use-zone-on|."
msgstr ""
"Tentokrát vložíme nejakú časť klipu, aby *presne zodpovedala* zóne časovej "
"osi. Preto teraz musíme zapnúť Použiť zónu časovej osi |timeline-use-zone-"
"on|."

#: ../../tips_and_tricks/useful_info/insert_overwrite_advanced_timeline_editing.rst:123
#: ../../tips_and_tricks/useful_info/insert_overwrite_advanced_timeline_editing.rst:246
msgid ""
"The **timeline zone bar** is now *bright* and shows the duration of the "
"timeline zone."
msgstr ""
"Panel **zóny časovej osi** je teraz *svetlý* a zobrazuje trvanie zóny "
"časovej osi."

#: ../../tips_and_tricks/useful_info/insert_overwrite_advanced_timeline_editing.rst:133
msgid "Setting the in-point in the clip for insertion"
msgstr "Nastavenie vstupného bodu v klipe na vloženie"

#: ../../tips_and_tricks/useful_info/insert_overwrite_advanced_timeline_editing.rst:135
#: ../../tips_and_tricks/useful_info/insert_overwrite_advanced_timeline_editing.rst:256
msgid ""
"We only need to set the **in point** for our source clip. The out point does "
"not matter, as it will be determined automatically by the length of the "
"timeline zone."
msgstr ""
"Potrebujeme nastaviť iba **vstupný bod** pre náš zdrojový klip. Výstupný bod "
"nie je dôležitý, pretože bude automaticky určený dĺžkou zóny časovej osi."

#: ../../tips_and_tricks/useful_info/insert_overwrite_advanced_timeline_editing.rst:145
msgid "Defining the timeline zone to be overwritten"
msgstr "Definovanie zóny časovej osi na prepísanie"

#: ../../tips_and_tricks/useful_info/insert_overwrite_advanced_timeline_editing.rst:147
msgid ""
"Now, mark (using :kbd:`I` and :kbd:`O` or |zone-in| or |zone-out| ) or place "
"(drag the zone left or right) the **timeline zone** into which you want to "
"insert a part of your source clip. The timeline cursor position now does not "
"matter."
msgstr ""
"Teraz označte (pomocou :kbd:`I` a :kbd:`O` alebo |zone-in| alebo |zone-out|) "
"alebo umiestnite (potiahnite zónu doľava alebo doprava) **zónu časovej "
"osi**, do ktorej chcete vložiť časť zdrojového klipu. Pozícia kurzora "
"časovej osi teraz nie je dôležitá."

#: ../../tips_and_tricks/useful_info/insert_overwrite_advanced_timeline_editing.rst:149
msgid ""
"Make sure to select the **correct track** using the :kbd:`Up` and :kbd:"
"`Down` keys and pressing :kbd:`Shift+T` to mark the track as the target for "
"the operation (see **(1)** in the screenshot)."
msgstr ""
"Uistite sa, že ste vybrali **správnu stopu** pomocou kláves :kbd:`Hore` a :"
"kbd:`Dole` a stlačením :kbd:`Shift+T` označíte stopu ako cieľ operácie "
"(pozri **(1)** na snímke obrazovky)."

#: ../../tips_and_tricks/useful_info/insert_overwrite_advanced_timeline_editing.rst:160
msgid ""
"Timeline with clip inserted into and having overwritten the timeline zone"
msgstr "Časová os s klipom vloženým do a prepísaným zónou časovej osi"

#: ../../tips_and_tricks/useful_info/insert_overwrite_advanced_timeline_editing.rst:168
msgid ""
"Overwrite starts at the beginning of the timeline zone, and not at the "
"timeline cursor position (because we chose to enable the timeline zone in "
"our very first step)"
msgstr ""
"Prepísanie začína na začiatku zóny časovej osi, a nie na pozícii kurzora "
"časovej osi (pretože sme sa rozhodli povoliť zónu časovej osi v prvom kroku)"

#: ../../tips_and_tricks/useful_info/insert_overwrite_advanced_timeline_editing.rst:169
msgid "Locked tracks are unaffected, such as the top-most track in our example"
msgstr ""
"Zamknuté stopy nie sú ovplyvnené, napríklad najhornajšia stopa v našom "
"príklade"

#: ../../tips_and_tricks/useful_info/insert_overwrite_advanced_timeline_editing.rst:170
msgid ""
"Unlocked tracks get affected in that whatever is at the insertion point and "
"later in the timeline gets shifted away to make room for the insertion"
msgstr ""
"Nezamknuté stopy sú ovplyvnené v tom zmysle, že všetko na bode vloženia a "
"neskôr v časovej osi sa posunie, aby sa uvoľnilo miesto pre vloženie"

#: ../../tips_and_tricks/useful_info/insert_overwrite_advanced_timeline_editing.rst:176
msgid "Overwrite Timeline with Clip Zone"
msgstr "Prepísať časovú os zónou klipu"

#: ../../tips_and_tricks/useful_info/insert_overwrite_advanced_timeline_editing.rst:186
msgid ""
"As we are going to overwrite a clip zone into the timeline, first make sure "
"that the switch for Using Timeline Zone |timeline-use-zone-off| is crossed "
"out (it is *off*). This is also shown in the screenshot."
msgstr ""
"Keďže budeme prepisovať zónu klipu do časovej osi, najprv sa uistite, že "
"prepínač Použiť zónu časovej osi |timeline-use-zone-off| je prečiarknutý (je "
"*vypnutý*). Toto je tiež zobrazené na snímke obrazovky."

#: ../../tips_and_tricks/useful_info/insert_overwrite_advanced_timeline_editing.rst:196
msgid "Setting the clip region for the operation"
msgstr "Nastavenie oblasti klipu pre operáciu"

#: ../../tips_and_tricks/useful_info/insert_overwrite_advanced_timeline_editing.rst:198
msgid ""
"Next, mark the **clip region** of the source clip you want to insert and "
"overwrite what is in the timeline. You do this as usual, using either the :"
"kbd:`I` and :kbd:`O` shortcuts, or the set Zone In |zone-in| / Zone Out |"
"zone-out| buttons of the clip monitor."
msgstr ""
"Ďalej označte **oblasť klipu** zdrojového klipu, ktorý chcete vložiť a "
"prepísať obsah časovej osi. Urobíte to ako zvyčajne, pomocou klávesových "
"skratiek :kbd:`I` a :kbd:`O`, alebo tlačidiel nastavenia zóny Dovnútra |zone-"
"in| / Zvonka |zone-out| v monitore klipu."

#: ../../tips_and_tricks/useful_info/insert_overwrite_advanced_timeline_editing.rst:206
msgid "Setting the overwrite start point in the timeline"
msgstr "Nastavenie počiatočného bodu prepísania na časovej osi"

#: ../../tips_and_tricks/useful_info/insert_overwrite_advanced_timeline_editing.rst:208
msgid ""
"Now **place the timeline cursor** to where you want to start the overwrite."
msgstr ""
"Teraz **umiestnite kurzor časovej osi** na miesto, kde chcete začať "
"prepísanie."

#: ../../tips_and_tricks/useful_info/insert_overwrite_advanced_timeline_editing.rst:210
msgid ""
"Also make sure to select the **correct track** using the :kbd:`Up` and :kbd:"
"`Down` keys to navigate up and down the track list and pressing :kbd:`Shift"
"+T` to mark the track as the target for the operation. The currently "
"selected track is marked with a semi-transparent selection color (depending "
"on your particular color theme); the **active** track is marked with a green "
"box (see **(1)** in the screenshot)"
msgstr ""
"Tiež sa uistite, že ste vybrali **správnu stopu** pomocou klávesov :kbd:`Up` "
"a :kbd:`Down` na navigáciu hore a dole v zozname stôp a stlačením :kbd:`Shift"
"+T` označte stopu ako cieľ operácie. Aktuálne vybratá stopa je označená "
"polopriesvitnou farbou výberu (v závislosti od vašej farebnej témy); "
"**aktívna** stopa je označená zeleným rámom (pozri **(1)** na snímke "
"obrazovky)"

#: ../../tips_and_tricks/useful_info/insert_overwrite_advanced_timeline_editing.rst:218
msgid "Clip region overwrote parts of the timeline"
msgstr "Oblasť klipu prepísala časti časovej osi"

#: ../../tips_and_tricks/useful_info/insert_overwrite_advanced_timeline_editing.rst:220
#: ../../tips_and_tricks/useful_info/insert_overwrite_advanced_timeline_editing.rst:283
msgid ""
"Finally press the :kbd:`B` shortcut, or click the Overwrite Clip Zone "
"toolbar button |timeline-overwrite|, or use :menuselection:`Menu --> "
"Sequence --> Insertion --> Overwrite Clip Zone in Timeline`."
msgstr ""
"Nakoniec stlačte klávesovú skratku :kbd:`B`, alebo kliknite na tlačidlo "
"panela nástrojov Prepísať zónu klipu |timeline-overwrite|, alebo použite :"
"menuselection:`Menu --> Sekvencia --> Vkladanie --> Prepísať zónu klipu na "
"časovej osi`."

#: ../../tips_and_tricks/useful_info/insert_overwrite_advanced_timeline_editing.rst:224
msgid ""
"Note that the overwrite removed the same portion also in not-active tracks. "
"In order to avoid that, lock the other tracks by clicking on the |track-"
"unlocked| icon in the track header (see **(2)** in the screenshots)."
msgstr ""
"Všimnite si, že prepísanie odstránilo rovnakú časť aj v neaktívnych stopách. "
"Aby ste tomu zabránili, uzamknite ostatné stopy kliknutím na ikonu |track-"
"unlocked| v záhlaví stopy (pozri **(2)** na snímkach obrazovky)."

#: ../../tips_and_tricks/useful_info/insert_overwrite_advanced_timeline_editing.rst:228
msgid ""
"Overwrite starts at the timeline cursor, and not at the timeline zone start "
"(because we chose to ignore it in our very first step)."
msgstr ""
"Prepísanie začína pri kurzore časovej osi, a nie na začiatku zóny časovej "
"osi (pretože sme sa rozhodli ignorovať ju v úplne prvom kroku)."

#: ../../tips_and_tricks/useful_info/insert_overwrite_advanced_timeline_editing.rst:230
msgid ""
"Unlocked tracks get affected in that whatever is at the insertion point and "
"later in the timeline gets removed for the duration of the clip region."
msgstr ""
"Odomknuté stopy sú ovplyvnené v tom zmysle, že čokoľvek sa nachádza v bode "
"vloženia a neskôr na časovej osi, bude odstránené po dobu trvania oblasti "
"klipu."

#: ../../tips_and_tricks/useful_info/insert_overwrite_advanced_timeline_editing.rst:234
msgid "Overwrite Timeline Zone with Clip"
msgstr "Prepísanie zóny časovej osi klipom"

#: ../../tips_and_tricks/useful_info/insert_overwrite_advanced_timeline_editing.rst:244
msgid ""
"This time, we are going to insert some part of a clip to *exactly fit* into "
"the timeline zone and *overwrite* what is in it. So we now need to switch on "
"Using the Timeline Zone |timeline-use-zone-on|."
msgstr ""
"Tentoraz vložíme časť klipu tak, aby *presne zodpovedala* zóne časovej osi a "
"*prepísala* jej obsah. Teraz teda musíme zapnúť Použiť zónu časovej osi |"
"timeline-use-zone-on|."

#: ../../tips_and_tricks/useful_info/insert_overwrite_advanced_timeline_editing.rst:254
msgid "Setting the in-point in the clip for the operation"
msgstr "Nastavenie vstupného bodu v klipe pre operáciu"

#: ../../tips_and_tricks/useful_info/insert_overwrite_advanced_timeline_editing.rst:266
msgid "Defining the timeline zone for overwriting"
msgstr "Definovanie zóny časovej osi pre prepísanie"

#: ../../tips_and_tricks/useful_info/insert_overwrite_advanced_timeline_editing.rst:268
msgid ""
"Now, mark (using :kbd:`I` and :kbd:`O` or |zone-in| or |zone-out| ) or place "
"(drag the zone left or right) the **timeline zone** that you want to "
"overwrite with part of your source clip. The timeline cursor position now "
"does not matter."
msgstr ""
"Teraz označte (pomocou :kbd:`I` a :kbd:`O` alebo |zone-in| alebo |zone-"
"out| ) alebo umiestnite (ťahaním zóny vľavo alebo vpravo) **zónu časovej "
"osi**, ktorú chcete prepísať časťou zdrojového klipu. Poloha kurzora časovej "
"osi teraz nehrá rolu."

#: ../../tips_and_tricks/useful_info/insert_overwrite_advanced_timeline_editing.rst:270
msgid ""
"Make sure to select the **correct track** using the :kbd:`Up` and :kbd:"
"`Down` keys and pressing :kbd:`Shift+T` to mark the track as the target for "
"the operation. The currently selected track is marked with a semi-"
"transparent selection color (depending on your particular color theme); the "
"**active** track is marked with a green box (see **(1)** in the screenshot)."
msgstr ""
"Uistite sa, že ste vybrali **správnu stopu** pomocou klávesov :kbd:`Up` a :"
"kbd:`Down` a stlačením :kbd:`Shift+T` označte stopu ako cieľ operácie. "
"Aktuálne vybratá stopa je označená polopriesvitnou farbou výberu (v "
"závislosti od vašej farebnej témy); **aktívna** stopa je označená zeleným "
"rámom (pozri **(1)** na snímke obrazovky)."

#: ../../tips_and_tricks/useful_info/insert_overwrite_advanced_timeline_editing.rst:281
msgid "Timeline with clip having overwritten the timeline zone"
msgstr "Časová os s klipom, ktorý prepísal zónu časovej osi"

#: ../../tips_and_tricks/useful_info/insert_overwrite_advanced_timeline_editing.rst:289
msgid ""
"Overwrite starts at the beginning of the timeline zone, and not from the "
"timeline cursor position (because we chose to enable the timeline zone in "
"our very first step)"
msgstr ""
"Prepísanie začína na začiatku zóny časovej osi, a nie od pozície kurzora "
"časovej osi (pretože sme sa rozhodli povoliť zónu časovej osi v úplne prvom "
"kroku)"

#: ../../tips_and_tricks/useful_info/insert_overwrite_advanced_timeline_editing.rst:290
msgid ""
"Locked tracks are unaffected, such as the top-most track in our example (see "
"**(2)** in the screenshot above)"
msgstr ""
"Zamknuté stopy nie sú ovplyvnené, napríklad najhörnejšia stopa v našom "
"príklade (pozri **(2)** na snímke obrazovky vyššie)"

#: ../../tips_and_tricks/useful_info/insert_overwrite_advanced_timeline_editing.rst:291
msgid ""
"Unlocked tracks get affected in that whatever is at the insertion point and "
"later in the timeline gets shifted for the duration set by the timeline zone."
msgstr ""
"Odomknuté stopy sú ovplyvnené v tom zmysle, že čokoľvek sa nachádza v bode "
"vloženia a neskôr na časovej osi, bude posunuté o dobu trvania nastavenú "
"zónou časovej osi."

#: ../../tips_and_tricks/useful_info/insert_overwrite_advanced_timeline_editing.rst:292
msgid ""
"For more details about how to set the tracks as source and target check :ref:"
"`three_point_editing`"
msgstr ""
"Viac podrobností o tom, ako nastaviť stopy ako zdroj a cieľ, nájdete v :ref:"
"`three_point_editing`"

#: ../../tips_and_tricks/useful_info/insert_overwrite_advanced_timeline_editing.rst:295
msgid "Notes"
msgstr "Poznámky"

